<title>USA: Oncor asks Lehman to assist in possible sale.</title>
<headline>Oncor asks Lehman to assist in possible sale.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oncor Inc said Monday it engaged Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc, the investment banking firm, to help the company secure strategic alliances, including the possible sale of the company.</p>
<p>Oncor develops, manufactures and markets gene-based test systems and related products for use in the detection and management of cancer and other human disease.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
